1
00:00:15,528 --> 00:00:19,700
Salut Marinette, tu connais ce quartier ?
Hi, Marinette, do you know this neighborhood?

2
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:24,332
Oui, ce quartier est près du centre du village.
Yes, this neighborhood is near the center of the village.

3
00:00:24,432 --> 00:00:29,180
Allons au centre. Quel chemin prendre ?
Let’s go to the center. Which path should we take?

4
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:33,524
Suis le trottoir jusqu’au pont, s’il te plaît.
Follow the sidewalk to the bridge, please.

5
00:00:33,624 --> 00:00:37,460
Après le pont, on tourne au carrefour ?
After the bridge, do we turn at the intersection?

6
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:42,308
Oui, puis au rond-point, prends la deuxième sortie.
Yes, then at the roundabout, take the second exit.

7
00:00:42,408 --> 00:00:45,476
Et la boulangerie est au coin ?
And is the bakery on the corner?

8
00:00:45,576 --> 00:00:49,676
Oui, juste là, au coin de la rue !
Yes, right there, on the corner of the street!
